      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Second feedback/option for this would be~\n\nA function inside a 'vrc pickup script'/'vrc object pool'/'udonbehaivor'\n\nTo contain a function to request a link to that function on the exact transform parent and make a linked connection again. After it's locally Initialize. \n\nMaking it possible to SYNC unsynced object, or locally Initialize gameobject/scripts.",
