  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-04-01T13:57:04.383Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Would be nice feature if you can Network Initialize a object. Having the ability to scale up 'seats' for games with a udon script directly attached and those able to be directly synced.\n\nThere probably also other use cases. But now initializing a object that has a script on it is just a local script and not network synced (even if its build for it)",
